    "%@ 不支持 effort none，只能走黄色路径（会明显变慢）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ does not support effort none and can only use the yellow path, which is significantly slower."
