    },
    "%@ 没有删除（不在完全卸载要删的清单里；确定不要的话，在访达里删除）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ was not deleted (it is not on the complete uninstall list; delete it in Finder if you no longer need it)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有删除（不在完全卸载要删的清单里；确定不要的话，在访达里删除）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 的声音来源已不可用，请打开应用后重试，或在当前场景中重新选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio from %@ is no longer available. Open the app and try again, or choose another source for this scenario."
