    },
    "只删除按现有保留规则已过期或超出数量、容量限制的诊断录音、字幕分析、文字记录和延迟事件；不会清空全部数据，删除后无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes only diagnostic recordings, subtitle analyses, transcripts, and latency events that have expired or exceed count or storage limits under the current retention rules. Does not clear all data. Deletion cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只删除按现有保留规则已过期或超出数量、容量限制的诊断录音、字幕分析、文字记录和延迟事件；不会清空全部数据，删除后无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在会议里所有参与者都已同意录音时才可以录（德国《刑法典》§201 把未经同意录下非公开谈话列为犯罪）。录音只存在这台 Mac 上，24 小时后自动删除，不进诊断包。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record only when every participant in the meeting has consented. Recording a non-public conversation without consent is a criminal offense under §201 of the German Criminal Code. Recordings stay on this Mac, are deleted automatically after 24 hours, and are excluded from diagnostics bundles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只在会议里所有参与者都已同意录音时才可以录（德国《刑法典》§201 把未经同意录下非公开谈话列为犯罪）。录音只存在这台 Mac 上，24 小时后自动删除，不进诊断包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
