    "对方的声音只在会议进行时、你当场确认“所有参与者都已同意录音”之后才录（德国《刑法典》§201）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Others’ audio is recorded only during a meeting, after you confirm for that session that all participants have consented to recording (German Criminal Code §201)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方的声音只在会议进行时、你当场确认“所有参与者都已同意录音”之后才录（德国《刑法典》§201）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
