    "将停止本地引擎并删除当前使用的合成模型。本地语音合成将不可用，识别模型保留；重新下载并选择合成模型后可恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local engine will stop and the active synthesis model will be deleted. Local speech synthesis will be unavailable. The recognition model is kept; download and select a synthesis model to restore speech."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将停止本地引擎并删除当前使用的合成模型。本地语音合成将不可用，识别模型保留；重新下载并选择合成模型后可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将停止本地引擎并删除当前使用的识别模型。Qwen 识别将不可用，语音合成模型保留；可使用 Apple Speech，或重新下载并选择档位恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local engine will stop and the active recognition model will be deleted. Qwen recognition will be unavailable; the speech synthesis model will remain. Use Apple Speech, or download the model again and select a tier to restore it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将停止本地引擎并删除当前使用的识别模型。Qwen 识别将不可用，语音合成模型保留；可使用 Apple Speech，或重新下载并选择档位恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除：虚拟麦克风 · 引擎与模型 · 我的声音 · 术语表 · 日志缓存 · 设置与登录项 · 钥匙串中的 OpenAI key，并重置隐私权限。需管理员密码，声音中断约 1 秒；通话中不可卸载。完成后退出并移到废纸篓。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes the virtual microphone, engine and models, My voice, glossary, logs and caches, settings and login item, and the OpenAI key in Keychain, and resets privacy permissions. An administrator password is required; audio will stop for about 1 second. Uninstall is unavailable during a call. When finished, quit and move TalkTalk to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除：虚拟麦克风 · 引擎与模型 · 我的声音 · 术语表 · 日志缓存 · 设置与登录项 · 钥匙串中的 OpenAI key，并重置隐私权限。需管理员密码，声音中断约 1 秒；通话中不可卸载。完成后退出并移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将复用已下载的模型并应用所选档位；运行时如需安装或更新会另外下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded models will be reused and the selected tier applied. The runtime will be downloaded separately if installation or an update is needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将复用已下载的模型并应用所选档位；运行时如需安装或更新会另外下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将采集所有应用的声音（排除 TalkTalk、readread 及其子进程）；其他应用的声音也可能被转写。仅在会议来源采集失败时使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captures audio from all apps except TalkTalk, readread, and their child processes; audio from other apps may also be transcribed. Use only if capture from the meeting source fails."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将采集所有应用的声音（排除 TalkTalk、readread 及其子进程）；其他应用的声音也可能被转写。仅在会议来源采集失败时使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚无会议应用或 Phone 使用 TalkTalk Mic": {
