    "显示时间是字幕面板提交更新的时间；隐藏面板会另行标记。没有参考原文时，耗时和文字记录不代表翻译准确率。每次会话都需要单独开启分析。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display time is when the subtitle panel submits an update; hidden panels are marked separately. Without a reference transcript, timings and transcripts do not measure translation accuracy. Analysis must be enabled separately for each session."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
