    "会议尚未读取 TalkTalk Mic。请加入会议并开启麦克风；若仍未接通，请在会议里重新选择 TalkTalk Mic。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The meeting is not reading TalkTalk Mic yet. Join the meeting and unmute; if it still does not connect, reselect TalkTalk Mic in the meeting."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会议尚未读取 TalkTalk Mic。请加入会议并开启麦克风；若仍未接通，请在会议里重新选择 TalkTalk Mic。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议正在使用其他麦克风。请在会议里选择 TalkTalk Mic。": {
